          "quote": "喝不进水或尿明显减少"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 was met because the doctor assessed or obtained current respiratory status, oxygenation, mental status, fever context, and later hydration/urine concerns, with clear immediate bedside escalation instructions.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
