          "quote": "有这些就马上按铃，不等医生来"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC8 was met because the caregiver repeatedly acknowledged the red flags, the no-self-adjustment medication boundary, and the plan to show the prepared information to the ward doctor.",
